# S5-07 schema-v12 ordered RDTSC prefix exact-nonce replay N=2

Date: 2026-11-17. Purpose: replay the two canonical dual-site stride-512 source runs with opt-in bounded CPL0 RDTSC prefix capture, retaining the same inputs, nonces, guest profile, and retirement budget. Diagnostic only; no comparator or guest CPU behavior changes.

## Inputs and execution

- Source series: `stage5-s5-07-rdtsc-dual-site-stride512-n2-20261116-a`; revision `71cca6233444a06ec69bf1623c7a46e791313b6a`; series SHA-256 `269cff1da52a8ae5196ab2f6a4d5f6eda1db2143df03325cdaa42167670449b6`; source comparison SHA-256 `989064d1f1ec9b4732e55fb44c4f28eb73dd41a9422163b0b14af4c5d558654e`.
- Runner release binary built from commit `1ea19d1`; SHA-256 `0b18d7847c19a1b54fb1fe02d390a5a8e60f5744138d509b333e066af89f2b3d`.
- Kernel SHA-256 `9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e`; initramfs `65acac38cd4c791154f33179fe2c9f2103dd7fdec51aacfd969ab4d9eb0aedb7`; ACPI `6fc25b091348d8ad314bdd0f4f579ec9dd3969c961020a7a61d2daeb8dc26d4d`; ACPI manifest `2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2`.
- Profile: stage4a, `--set-cpl0 --user-mode`, 128 MiB, `norandmaps`, `randomize_kstack_offset=off`, budget 3,000,000,000. Selected poll RIP `0xffffffff8271b34d`, stride 512; entry/sentinel RIP `0xffffffff8271b31b`. Added `--execution-observations-rdtsc-prefix`; each run wrote to a separate output path.
- Run 1 nonce: `OD518e8a0fda5d3f4600000175200000000`. Run 2 nonce: `OD518e8a2228ca02d300000175200000001`.
- Local macOS/aarch64 release runs were sequential. Sidecar creation-to-final-write durations were about 20:05 and 20:14; these include guest execution and serialization, not an isolated performance measurement.

## Outcomes and artifacts

Both runs loaded Linux, passed the exact nonce marker, and stopped `budget_exhausted` at retired count 2,999,999,998 with `diagnostic_not_counted`. Each run exactly matches its corresponding schema-v11 direct replay in stop object, UART bytes, complete entry stream, stride-512 poll samples, entry hits, and poll hits. Those direct replays matched the automatic source runs. The automatic source strict comparator remains `matches=false`; it was not rerun or relaxed here.

